-- title:
--   The padded extension count is at most $2^{13h}$
-- statement:
--   Let $m(h)=2^{12h}$. For $r\le h$,
--   $$
--   1+r\,m(h)\le2^{13h} .
--   $$
--
--   This bounds the base of the per-edge extension factor. It is the number of possible traces of an edge on a union of at most $m(h)$ edges, up to padding.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Combinatorics/DiscreteConvexity/CoveringNumericalBounds.lean#L42-L55

